  <name>Redis Viewer</name>
  <summary>Redis desktop client for large keyspaces and bottleneck analysis</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="zh_CN">面向大规模键空间与性能瓶颈分析的 Redis 桌面客户端</summary>
  <developer id="com.redisviewer">
    <name>RedisViewer</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Redis Viewer is a local Redis desktop client for browsing large keyspaces,
      inspecting Java serialized values, and analyzing SlowLog, BigKey, HotKey,
      CPU, memory, and cache-hit signals.
    </p>
    <p xml:lang="zh_CN">
      Redis Viewer 是一款本地 Redis 桌面客户端，支持大规模键空间浏览、Java 序列化值查看，
      以及 SlowLog、BigKey、HotKey、CPU、内存与缓存命中率等性能分析。
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Browse large keyspaces with SCAN and virtual scrolling</li>
      <li xml:lang="zh_CN">通过 SCAN 与虚拟滚动浏览大规模键空间</li>
      <li>Inspect Java serialized, Base64, Hex, and binary values</li>
      <li xml:lang="zh_CN">查看 Java 序列化、Base64、Hex 与二进制值</li>
      <li>Analyze SlowLog, BigKey, HotKey, and resource trends</li>
      <li xml:lang="zh_CN">分析 SlowLog、BigKey、HotKey 与资源趋势</li>
      <li>Store connection passwords in the system keychain</li>
      <li xml:lang="zh_CN">连接密码存储在系统密钥环中</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">com.redisviewer.RedisViewer.desktop</launchable>
